ll gets killed or times out before feedback arrives, re-run it - feedback remains queued until delivery. Poll delivery consumes the response, so read it completely. If it returns browser_disconnected, the review window stayed disconnected past its reconnect grace period but the session remains resumable; ask the user whether to reopen or end it, and do neither uninvited. Codex detected: completed background tasks may not resume Codex automatically, so keep the poll attached to the active turn."
